\item[S2] M. Bialy, C. Fierobe, A. Glutsyuk, M. Levi, A. Plakhov and S. Tabachnikov, \emph{Open problems on billiards and geometric optics} (2021), arXiv:2110.10750v2, Serge Tabachnikov, Problem 5, pp. 12--13. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/2110.10750v2}.
